# axiom explain, every code and every spelling.
# AX1001-AX5001 were materialized from the Rust compiler at commit 1041f11 on
# 2026-08-08; AX3018 and above (macros, visibility, limits, traits, effects, the
# FFI boundary, type soundness) postdate it and originate in self_host/explain.ax. The list COLOUR is RECONSTRUCTED, not captured. AX2004 was REWRITTEN on 2026-08-18 when the `extern` FFI landed: its captured text said generated code links no C library, which stopped being true for a program that binds a std Rust crate. It is the one code in the AX1001-AX5001 range that is no longer the 2026-08-08 byte.
